	(text "TWO CAN FD BUSES, BOTH WITH TRANSCEIVERS. v2.4.5 wired CAN2 to the MCU\nwith no transceiver at all, so it was never usable as a bus.\n\nTERMINATION IS SWITCHABLE. 120 ohm in series with a solder jumper,\nFITTED by default. On a three-board TMR chain the electrically middle\nmodule clears JP1 - it does not get R409 desoldered, which is what the\nold board required. Verify ~60 ohm across CAN_H/CAN_L, bus unpowered,\nbefore trusting it."
		(at 31.75 13.97 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "849ef558-adf2-4bf9-bfa5-6526521d6ea0")
	)
